    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are helplines but they dont actually change anything. they just give you numbers to call while the situation stays exactly the same. it's not like i haven't tried talking to people. it's just... it feels like i'm staring at a wall that's slowly closing in on me every single day. everything is just so draining and i'm just so incredibly exhausted.",
